<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-08T06:24:33.304Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 06:24:33 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Coast Guard is containing an oil spill off Mariveles, Bataan, removing 800 kg of oil-contaminated debris while the DENR orders assessment and containment. China has deployed more than 100 warships and coast guard vessels across the western Pacific and sent a survey vessel with unidentified equipment into Scarborough Shoal, heightening maritime tension. The U.S. Maritime Security Initiative is providing lasting capability assistance to Southeast Asian partners, including the Philippines. The Philippines is preparing security for the 49th ASEAN Summit in Manila from 16 to 18 November, and the PCG delivered 7,000 DSWD food packs to disaster-affected residents in Batanes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scmp.com/news/china/diplomacy/article/3373651/manila-weighs-second-south-china-sea-legal-case-against-beijing-analyst&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxPUGwzMFhEc2Y4UHJPSjI3RDdnWmdZLTNDTFpObF82WHpNV0kteTd5LVdlZ3RzdzEzZVlQWWZPN1d2eDVFc0plSjNxa1ZnSWJRYnEtQnFHV3JPUW1PTjgyZjBBdGZ2R09ONHBKa2JTbmlkR1pRVUNWWFdTb1VIXzFwTG45ZTdsQjhHVDlJUzFCdUZoOU1pY0I4ZFBIajBOeHVqN2VoRVEwMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;thechronicle.com.ph&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxOQUFmZGo5ZTQwVkVqUEs3bThQT05xVXRBd1pQM0ROVEJKa1VHNElHUi16bVhodUNhY2J3TzZZUFBkSThzalBNaklCT0d4c0ZZY1dmSVJSaE9yQlRiQmtJcHFHX0VHYkU1Z0FuYU9Cc3hkZjdpclJXYWNWSWpsMHZXVlFISEJPOU1tcnUxX19yRjd2aV9rN2RROE1HenVQR1hjTDRvSDJvTmtxam9BdUJVYmd4bEI2azNjdkg0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Malaysia Sun&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxNMktCUzlUYWtIZm9zOUVBeHQ5a3NDRGNJZHNxZk9oWGpEUVVwNlVlQmxHeFdFcDZ4dnAxMjQ2RmdhM1pDYzZGbnJxNGptMlNtSUZ4R1VWT3NhbG9vWnBfRnFSMHVmNzFCLTlM